{"symbol":"3CIT","yahoo":"3CIT.BO","bse":null,"isin":null,"name":"3C IT Solutions & Telecoms (India) Limited","sector":"Technology","industry":"Information Technology Services","website":"https://3citsolutions.com","about":"3C IT Solutions & Telecoms (India) Limited retails laptops, accessories, related products, and other networking components in India. The company offers infrastructure solutions, including end user and device configuration, data protection, computer accessories, networking solutions, IT security solutions, and audio-video solutions. It also provides digital business solutions, such as digital transformation, cloud solutions, and IoT integration. In addition, the company offers consulting solutions, including strategic and technology consulting, and process optimization. The company was formerly known as 3C IT Solutions & Telecoms (India) Private Limited and changed its name to 3C IT Solutions & Telecoms (India) Limited in August 2023. 3C IT Solutions & Telecoms (India) Limited was incorporated in 2015 and is based in Pune, India.","updated":"2026-09-26T06:04:40+00:00","quote":{"price":17.5,"prevClose":17.5,"marketCap":10.54,"high52":25.1,"low52":13.02,"pe":18.23,"bookValue":22.06,"dividendRate":0.0,"roe":4.43,"shares":0.602,"insiders":64.95,"institutions":0.0},"prices":{"dates":["2024-06-12","2024-06-13","2024-06-14","2024-06-18","2024-06-19","2024-06-20","2024-06-21","2024-06-24","2024-06-25","2024-06-26","2024-06-27","2024-06-28","2024-07-01","2024-07-02","2024-07-03","2024-07-04","2024-07-05","2024-07-08","2024-07-09","2024-07-10","2024-07-11","2024-07-12","2024-07-15","2024-07-16","2024-07-18","2024-07-19","2024-07-22","2024-07-23","2024-07-24","2024-07-25","2024-07-26","2024-07-29","2024-07-30","2024-07-31","2024-08-01","2024-08-02","2024-08-05","2024-08-06","2024-08-07","2024-08-08","2024-08-09","2024-08-12","2024-08-13","2024-08-14","2024-08-16","2024-08-19","2024-08-20","2024-08-21","2024-08-22","2024-08-23","2024-08-26","2024-08-27","2024